  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_1_1
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>SCATTER IN BASE GAME</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1_1
    value: "<size=22>- 3 Scatter symbols on reels 1, 3 and 5 triggers \nWheel Bonus
      during Base Games.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: 
    value: 
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_1_2
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>WILD</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1_2
    value: <size=18>- Wild substitutes for all symbols except Scatter symbol.</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_1
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>EXTRA BET</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_1
    value: '<size=21>

      - 50% of Line Bet is added as Extra Bet to enable Extra Wild Feature and Wheel
      Bonus.

      </size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_2
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>EXTRA WILD FEATURE</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_2
    value: "<size=21>\n- During Base Games or Free Games after a spin, Extra Wild
      symbols randomly appear on the reels.\n\n- When additional Wild symbol overlaps
      with already existing Wild symbol on a spot, then that Wild symbol upgrades
      to 2x Wild. \n\n- All reels reset to their standard layout every spin.\n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_3
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>WHEEL BONUS</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_3
    value: '<size=21>

      - 3 Scatter symbols on reels 1, 3 and 5 triggers Wheel Bonus during Base Games.


      - You can collect Credits or Wilds for Free Games.


      - You can win Grand or Mega Jackpot.


      - You can win Grand or Mega Jackpot multiple times during Wheel Bonus. Only
      first claimed Jackpot awards Jackpot Progressive. Afterwards, Grand Jackpot
      awards  300x Base Bet and Mega Jackpot awards 100x Base Bet.


      - Wheel Bonus ends when winning Free Games.

      </size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3_1
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>FREE GAMES</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_1
    value: '<size=21>

      - Wheel Bonus triggers 8 Free Games when Free Games wedge is won.


      - Collected Wilds symbols from the Wheel Bonus are added to the reels at the
      beginning of the Free Games.

      </size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3_2
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>SCATTER IN FREE GAMES</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_2
    value: <size=18>- 3 Scatter symbols on reels 1, 3 and 5 re-triggers 8 Free Games
      during Free Games.</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3_3
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>GOLD SCATTER IN FREE GAMES</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_3
    value: '<size=21>

      - Gold Scatter only appears on reel 5 during Free Games.


      - Up to 5 Gold Scatters can appear during Free Games.


      - 2 Scatter symbols and one Gold Scatter symbol re-triggers 8 Free Games, adding
      20 Wilds to the reels.


      - Gold Scatter on reel 5 that does not re-trigger Free Games adds only 10 Wilds
      to the reels next spin.


      - Claimed Gold Scatter turns into normal Scatter for the remaining Free Games.

      </size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_5_1
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>LINES</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_LINE_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff></size>40 LINES</size>
